# NeonBitOS License

## NeonBitOS Core (Public Domain)

All original NeonBitOS code, scripts, and configuration files created for this project are released into the **Public Domain** under The Unlicense.

This includes:
- Build scripts
- Configuration files
- Custom applications (pidigits)
- Documentation
- System configuration (rcS, inittab, profile)

Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or distribute this software, either in source code form or as a compiled binary, for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any means.

