- License: GPL-2.0
- Source: https://www.kernel.org/
- Not redistributed in this repository

### ToyBox
- License: 0BSD (Public Domain equivalent)
- Source: https://github.com/landley/toybox
- Not redistributed in this repository

### Nano
- License: GPL-3.0
- Source: https://www.nano-editor.org/
- Not redistributed in this repository

### strace
- License: LGPL-2.1
- Source: https://github.com/strace/strace
- Not redistributed in this repository

### Termrex (Optional game)
- License: MIT
- Author: Satya Prakash Dahal
- Source: https://github.com/SATYADAHAL/termrex
- Not redistributed in this repository

### Bash
- License: GPL-3.0
- Included from system libraries

